div.p:
[He opens the door; 
                     Solveig
                       goes in. He stands still for a while, then laughs aloud with joy and leaps into the air.

[Huddles together apprehensively, and keeps still for a while. The ape makes a motion; 
                     Peer Gynt
                       begins coaxing and wheedling him, as he might a dog.
